{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016010038524-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016073429\"/><p>垃圾收集站火光熊熊，消防開喉撲救。</p><p>石硤尾發生火警。昨晚（15日）10時許，有人報案指石硤尾邨美益樓對開垃圾收集站起火，且波及附近一棵樹。消防到場開動1條喉及派出1隊煙帽隊灌救，其後將火救熄。消防經初步調查後，相信有人遺下火種焫着被棄置於上址的傢具，起火原因無可疑。事件中，約40人疏散，無人受傷，</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.978639+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T17:00:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:52.578622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:52.578622+00:00","content_hash":"113106ee29b8ea8ea284c92954ebcc97af8fa8aee25e4a59c06c15105fdcf912","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}